…\n\nEpisode 2 - Zeni no Shikaku: Sono Hi Iinchou no Junketsu wa Ubawareta...\n\nClass president Mizuki Naruse couldn’t stand by and watch as her classmate Yui Maeda was being raped by a group of male students, so, driven by a sense of justice, she went to the location they designated after school. Mizuki chooses to offer her own body in exchange for making the male students promise never to have anything to do with Yui again. “This is a consensual act; it is by no means rape”. Even as she is forced to declare this in front of the camera and is molested by the male students, she maintains a resolute demeanor. However, as her hymen is torn and she is penetrated repeatedly, she gradually begins to notice changes in her body.\n\n(Source: Mediabank, translated)"},"tags":[{"name":"Fellatio","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Defloration","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Drugs","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nakadashi","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Revenge","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Facial","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Large Breasts","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anal Sex","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rape","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Tooi Kimi ni, Boku wa Todokanai","english":null,"native":"遠い君に、僕は届かない","romaji":"Tooi Kimi ni, Boku wa Todokanai","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"君至彼方、已非吾能企及"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"adult"}